//! Checkpoint 4, behaviour tests: does the library do what SPEC.md says?
//!
//! Run: cargo test --test behaviour
//!
//! All of these must pass, in debug and with `--release`, for the "pass"
//! level in RUBRIC.md. Do not edit this file.
//!
//! Everything that starts a thread or waits for one runs with a time limit,
//! so a deadlock becomes a failed test with a message, not a test run that
//! hangs.

